                <p class="entry-text">
                    (<bdi class="hebrew hebrew-token tooltip-trigger" lang="he" dir="rtl" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="hebrew" data-tooltip-label="אֲבִיָּה" data-transliteration="ʾăḇiyyâ" data-meanings="Abias|nome próprio masculino">אֲבִיָּה</bdi>)
                    <strong>Abias</strong>,
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="B-D-F §3" data-tooltip-text="Blass-Debrunner-Funk, gramática do grego do Novo Testamento, §3">B-D-F §3</span>.
                    <span class="sense-number">1.</span>
                    Filho de Roboão
                    (<a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/1CH.3.10" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">1 Cr 3.10</a>),
                    um antepassado de Jesus,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/MAT.1.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mt 1.7ab</a>.
                    <span class="sense-number">2.</span>
                    Fundador da classe de sacerdotes à qual Zacarias pertencia
                    (<a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/1CH.24.10" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">1 Cr 24.10</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/2ES.22.16" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2 Esd 22.16 s.</a>;
                    o nome Zacarias ocorre na última passagem),
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/LUK.1.5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lc 1.5</a>.
                    Veja
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="ἐφημερία" data-meanings="turno de serviço|classe sacerdotal">ἐφημερία</span>,
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="Ζαχαρίας" data-meanings="Zacarias">Ζαχαρίας</span>.
                </p>
